#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-modules/scour.xml:28
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Scour</application> is an SVG (Scalable Vector Graphics)  "
"optimizer/cleaner that reduces their size by optimizing structure and "
"removing unnecessary data."
msgstr ""
"&quot;<application>Scour</application>&quot; é um otimizador/limpador "
"&quot;Scalable Vector Graphics&quot; (&quot;SVG&quot;) que reduz o tamanho "
"deles otimizando a estrutura e removendo dados desnecessários."

